t party, but was shocked one day after seeing her enter a hotel room with another man. This led him to develop a complex about his lack of romantic experience."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He joined the group to overcome the shock of his lost love and to lose his virginity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"translated from DLSite"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28420"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f50fc0e6e5e532a955e7be0ebf9889a3b340df4db7d1f7b1e1208e9c97b4c32.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b9f335354232fc09bd34bc0a3b771b1d6dc67502f60568203c1bef1c5af96bf.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28421","characterName":"海老名 泰","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28421"},"originalCharacterName":"海老名 泰","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a school teacher who teaches the third year class."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A typical liberal arts type, he is not good at interacting with women. One of the group's participants, Fujimori Kotomi, is also in his class."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only woman he has ever had sex with is his wife, Ebina Rina, but she has been refusing to have sex with him for some time now, leaving him sexless."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He joined the group to relieve his frustration."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from DLSite"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28421"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d59b6857e67845cb7afdf1af6a9712155458db5bbd5b98136db49dc9b112d852.webp","fallbackUrl":"https: